'''Talonbranch Glade''' is a modest [[Alliance]] outpost located in the far northern parts of [[Felwood]]. It is populated by a handful of [[night elves]], and is not a place where players stay longer than needed. Talonbranch Glade is located a bit south of [[Timbermaw Hold]], which leads to [[Moonglade]] and [[Winterspring]].

The ancient treant [[Ethwyr]] sacrificed himself to cleanse this part of Felwood, and druids loyal to [[Fandral Staghelm]] arrived to study the area and attempt to replicate his feat. However, not all is what it seems.<ref>[[Patch 1.16.4#An Effort to Cleanse Felwood]]</ref>

